# Spark IDE - proven status.txt clears * after save.
# After key-quit-alone 6aab469. Complements status_new_star: new
# with path then save => status.txt path without trailing *.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_status_clear.spark
# No Electron. No keymap n. No new asm - documents proven status only.

ide new "out/ide/status_clear.spark"

ide save
